Ọrọ nigbati: ['html'] ṣe: { <- (
		ara-rẹ
		rọpo: ['&'] pẹlu: ['&amp;'],
		rọpo: ['<'] pẹlu: ['&lt;'],
		rọpo: ['>'] pẹlu: ['&gt;'],
		rọpo: ['"'] pẹlu: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Akojọ tuntun.

['Verbatim Syntax'] awọn-lẹta kọọkan: { :nọmba :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (nọmba), Letter: letter).
}.

Ijade list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list so-pọ: ['↵']).

Ijade kọ: template.

